ary\">No matches for <b>World Economic Forum</b> in the record yet.</div>\n  <div class=\"search-empty\">Try a different phrasing, or check <a href=\"/topics\">Topics</a> for browsable doorways.</div><div class=\"search-preview\">\n  <div class=\"search-preview-label\">AI-generated preview — not verified against any stored document. Not a fact.</div>\n  <div class=\"search-preview-body\">The **World Economic Forum (WEF)** is an international non-governmental organization and think tank based in **Cologny, Switzerland**, founded on **24 January 1971** by **Klaus Schwab**. Its primary mission is to engage business, political, academic, and other leaders to **shape global, regional, and industry agendas** through public-private cooperation.<br><br>The WEF is best known for its annual **meeting in Davos, Switzerland**, typically held in late January, which brings together approximately **3,000 participants**, including CEOs of its **1,000 member companies**, heads of state, and international organization representatives. The forum also produces research reports, convenes regional conferences, and hosts sector-specific initiatives to address critical global challenges such as **climate change, economic resilience, and artificial intelligence governance**.<br><br>Key characteristics of the organization include:<br>*   **Structure**: It is a foundation governed by a board of trustees comprising leaders from business, politics, and civil society, with **Larry Fink** serving as Chairman.<br>*   **History**: Originally named the **European Management Forum**, it was renamed the World Economic Forum in **1987** to broaden its scope beyond European business management to global economic and social issues.<br>*   **Themes**: Recent annual meetings have focused on topics like **&quot;Collaboration for the Intelligent Age&quot; (2025)** and **&quot;Cooperation in a Fragmented World&quot; (2023)**, with the **2026 meeting** scheduled for **19–23 January** under the theme **&quot;A Spirit of Dialogue&quot;**.<br>*   **Criticism**: The organization has faced scrutiny regarding its **corporate influence**, **financial transparency**, **tax-exempt status**, and the **environmental impact** of its annual gatherings.</div>\n  \n</div>\n</section>\n<style>\n  .search-section { max-width: 760px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 24px 80px; }\n  .search-h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--ink); }\n  .search-form { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .search-input { flex: 1; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 16px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); }\n  .search-input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 0; }\n  .search-go { padding: 12px 22px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px;\n    background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .search-go:hover { background: var(--accent-2); color: var(--paper); }\n  .search-summary { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 14px;\n    color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 22px; }\n  .search-hits { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\n  .search-hit { padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft); }\n  .search-link { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); }\n  .search-kind { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px;\n    background: var(--paper-2); color: var(--ink-3); letter-spacing: .04em; }\n  .search-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; flex: 1; }\n  .search-link:hover .search-title { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--ink-3); text-underline-offset: 4px; }\n  .search-snippet { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-3);\n    margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .search-score { font-family: